# New cleric domains
# Source: The (mostly) Complete Dragon Magazine Compendium - Spells (compendium pp. 1280-1362).
# DESC ends with the original Dragon/Dungeon Magazine issue and article. SOURCEPAGE = compendium PDF page.

Army	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Army	SOURCEPAGE:p.1355	DESC:You have the spell-like ability to inspire allies within 30 feet, giving them a +2 morale bonus on saving throws, attack rolls, ability checks, skill checks, and weapon damage rolls. Allies must be able to hear you speak for 1 round. Using this ability is a full-round action. It lasts a number of rounds equal to your Charisma bonus and can be used once per day. [Dragon #317 (Faiths of Faerûn – Battleguard of Tempus – Soldier-Saints of the Lord of Battle)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Army=1|Bless|Army=2|Lighten Load|Army=3|Prayer|Army=4|Divination|Army=5|Easy March|Army=6|Heroes' Feast|Army=7|Scrying (Greater)|Army=8|Heal (Mass)|Army=9|Teleportation Circle
Avarice	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Avarice	SOURCEPAGE:p.1355	DESC:Once per day, as a standard action, you may determine the most valuable item within 30 feet. An item's value is determined by its listed gold-piece value. If you cannot see the most valuable item within range, you become aware of its general location (within 5 feet), but you gain no insight into what the item is. This ability does not tell you the gold piece value of an item. [Dragon #323 (Seven Deadly Domains – Spells for Sinners)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Avarice=3|Locate Object|Avarice=4|Shrink Item|Avarice=5|Telekinesis|Avarice=6|Secret Chest|Avarice=7|Sequester|Avarice=8|Discern Location|Avarice=9|Antipathy
Beguilement	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Beguilement	SOURCEPAGE:p.1355	DESC:You cast compulsion spells at +1 caster level. [Dragon #312 (Thieves of Will – Evil Enchanters)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Beguilement=1|Hypnotism|Beguilement=2|Enthrall|Beguilement=3|Hypnotic Pattern|Beguilement=4|Deep Slumber|Beguilement=5|Confusion|Beguilement=6|Modify Memory|Beguilement=7|Suggestion (Mass)|Beguilement=8|Hold Person (Mass)|Beguilement=9|Irresistible Dance
Charity	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Charity	SOURCEPAGE:p.1355	DESC:Once per day, as a full-round action, you may reduce your hit points by up two times your class level and touch an ally to give him temporary hit points equal to that amount. For instance, a 5th-level cleric can give up to 10 hit points to an ally. Your ally retains these temporary hit points for 1 minute per your class level and you cannot reclaim them or use healing magic to regain them prematurely, even to save your own life. At the end of the effect you regain all the hit points you donated, even if your ally suffered injuries during this time. [Dragon #355 (Seven Saintly Domains)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Charity=1|Goodberry|Charity=2|Aid|Charity=3|Create Food and Water|Charity=4|Imbue with Spell Ability|Charity=5|Cure Light Wounds (Mass)|Charity=6|Heroes' Feast|Charity=7|Refuge|Charity=8|Mage's Magnificent Mansion|Charity=9|Heal (Mass)
Chastity	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Chastity	SOURCEPAGE:p.1356	DESC:Once per day, you may dispel a single spell effect targeting you as a targeted dispel magic spell. Caster level equals your character level. [Dragon #355 (Seven Saintly Domains)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Chastity=1|Shield of Faith|Chastity=2|Restoration (Lesser)|Chastity=3|Magic Vestment|Chastity=4|Spell Immunity|Chastity=5|Break Enchantment|Chastity=6|Interposing Hand|Chastity=7|Repulsion|Chastity=8|Antimagic Field|Chastity=9|Mind Blank
Chromatic Dragon	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Chromatic Dragon	SOURCEPAGE:p.1356	DESC:Choose a chromatic dragon color. You cannot later change the kind of dragon. Once per day, you may use a breath weapon similar to the chosen dragon's. This breath weapon deals 1d6 points of damage per five cleric levels you possess. A successful Reflex save (DC 10 + 1/2 your cleric level + your Charisma modifier) halves the damage. A black breathes a 60-foot line of acid, a blue breathes a 60-foot line of electricity, a green breathes a 30-foot cone of acid, a red breathes a 30-foot cone of fire, and a white breathes 30-foot cone of cold. [Dragon #344]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Chromatic Dragon=1|Cause Fear|Chromatic Dragon=2|Gust of Wind|Chromatic Dragon=4|Fear|Chromatic Dragon=6|Symbol of Fear|Chromatic Dragon=9|Weird
Emotion	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Emotion	SOURCEPAGE:p.1357	DESC:Your understanding of the mind and emotions allows you to more easily shrug off the effects of mind-affecting spells and effects. You gain a +4 bonus on Will saves to resist mind-affecting spells and spell-like abilities. [Dragon #340 (Eye of the Night – The Moon and Its Role in D&D)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Emotion=2|Hypnotism|Emotion=3|Rage|Emotion=4|Confusion|Emotion=5|Crushing Despair|Emotion=6|Nightmare|Emotion=7|Heroism (Greater)|Emotion=8|Insanity|Emotion=9|Weird
Gem Dragon	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Gem Dragon	SOURCEPAGE:p.1357	DESC:Add Autohypnosis, Knowledge (psionics), and Psi-craft to your list of cleric class skills. [Dragon #344 (Class Acts – Devotees of the Dragon)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Gem Dragon=1|True Strike|Gem Dragon=2|Detect Thoughts|Gem Dragon=4|Suggestion|Gem Dragon=7|True Seeing|Gem Dragon=8|Mind Blank|Gem Dragon=9|Foresight
Generosity	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Generosity	SOURCEPAGE:p.1357	DESC:Once per day, as an immediate action you may choose to cast a maximized conjuration (healing) spell without increasing the spell level or casting time. [Dragon #355 (Seven Saintly Domains)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Generosity=1|Deathwatch|Generosity=2|Shield Other|Generosity=3|Detect Thoughts|Generosity=4|Discern Lies|Generosity=5|True Seeing|Generosity=6|Prying Eyes|Generosity=7|Guards and Wards|Generosity=8|Teleport Object|Generosity=9|Foresight
Hope	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Hope	SOURCEPAGE:p.1358	DESC:Once per day, when you fail a skill check, attack roll, or saving throw, you may roll 1d6 and add it to the result. This ability is used after the result of the roll or check is revealed, but before any other actions are taken. [Dragon #340 (The Eternal Light – The Sun and Its Role In D&D)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Hope=1|Bless|Hope=2|Aid|Hope=3|Heroism|Hope=4|Good Hope|Hope=5|Atonement|Hope=6|Heroism (Greater)|Hope=7|Restoration (Greater)|Hope=8|Planar Ally (Greater)|Hope=9|Miracle
Humility	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Humility	SOURCEPAGE:p.1358	DESC:You cast all divination spells at +1 caster level. [Dragon #355 (Seven Saintly Domains)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Humility=1|Reduce Person|Humility=2|Hold Person|Humility=3|Bestow Curse|Humility=4|Ray of Exhaustion|Humility=5|Enervation|Humility=6|Waves of Fatigue|Humility=7|Symbol of Weakness|Humility=8|Spell Turning|Humility=9|Energy Drain
Hunt	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Hunt	SOURCEPAGE:p.1358	DESC:You gain Track as a bonus feat. [Dragon #342 (Class Acts – The Wild Hunt)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Hunt=1|Hide from Animals|Hunt=2|Bear's Endurance|Hunt=3|Snare|Hunt=4|Locate Creature|Hunt=5|Commune with Nature|Hunt=6|Find the Path|Hunt=7|Control Weather|Hunt=8|Discern Location|Hunt=9|Foresight
Hunger (DMC)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Hunger (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.1358	DESC:You are immune to natural poisons, diseases, or drugs that require ingestion. Substances delivered by touch, inhalation, or injection still affect you, and you are still subject to ingested toxins that are magical in nature. [Dragon #312 (The Ebon Maw – Beware the Waking Hunger)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Hunger (DMC)=2|Jaws of Adamantine|Hunger (DMC)=3|Cannibalize (DMC)|Hunger (DMC)=4|Caustic Bile|Hunger (DMC)=5|Enervation|Hunger (DMC)=6|Insatiable Hunger|Hunger (DMC)=9|Gate
Lung Dragon	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Lung Dragon	SOURCEPAGE:p.1359	DESC:You gain a +2 competence bonus on Charisma-based skill checks and Charisma checks against creatures of the dragon type or spirit subtype. This bonus increases to +4 against dragon (spirit) creatures. [Dragon #344 (Class Acts – Devotees of the Dragon)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Lung Dragon=1|Unseen Servant|Lung Dragon=2|Fog Cloud|Lung Dragon=4|Air Walk|Lung Dragon=7|Control Weather|Lung Dragon=8|Polymorph Any Object|Lung Dragon=9|Meteor Swarm
Metallic Dragon	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Metallic Dragon	SOURCEPAGE:p.1359	DESC:You gain damage reduction 1/adamantine. This increases by 1 per five cleric levels. [Dragon #344 (Class Acts – Devotees of the Dragon)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Metallic Dragon=2|Shield Other|Metallic Dragon=4|Protection from Energy|Metallic Dragon=5|Globe of Invulnerability (Lesser)|Metallic Dragon=6|Wall of Iron|Metallic Dragon=8|Iron Body
Night	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Night	SOURCEPAGE:p.1359	DESC:You gain low-light vision. If you already have low-light vision you gain darkvision with a range of 30 ft. [Dragon #342 (Class Acts – The Wild Hunt)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Night=1|Sleep|Night=2|Deeper Darkness|Night=3|Deep Slumber|Night=4|Phantom Steed|Night=5|Nightmare|Night=6|Shadow Walk|Night=7|Waves of Exhaustion|Night=8|Shadow Evocation (Greater)|Night=9|Shades
Patience	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Patience	SOURCEPAGE:p.1359	DESC:Once per day, as an immediate action, you may delay the effect of a spell that affects you for 10 rounds. You may choose to use this ability after you know the result of any saving throws for the spell (if any). [Dragon #355 (Seven Saintly Domains)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Patience=1|Sanctuary|Patience=2|Delay Poison|Patience=3|Protection from Energy|Patience=4|Slow|Patience=5|Hold Monster|Patience=6|Bear's Endurance (Mass)|Patience=7|Contingency|Patience=8|Sequester|Patience=9|Time Stop
Radiance	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Radiance	SOURCEPAGE:p.1360	DESC:You are immune to pattern effects. This is a supernatural ability. [Dragon #321 (The Limitless Light – A Tour of the Plane of Radiance)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Radiance=1|Color Spray|Radiance=2|Hypnotic Pattern|Radiance=3|Searing Light|Radiance=4|Faerie Fire|Radiance=5|Rainbow Pattern|Radiance=6|Rainbow|Radiance=7|Prismatic Spray|Radiance=8|Scintillating Pattern|Radiance=9|Prismatic Wall
Seduction	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Seduction	SOURCEPAGE:p.1360	DESC:You gain a +1 bonus on all Charisma checks and all opposed Charisma-based skill checks. [Dragon #312 (Thieves of Will – Evil Enchanters)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Seduction=1|Charm Person|Seduction=2|Eagle's Splendor|Seduction=3|Geas (Lesser)|Seduction=4|Suggestion|Seduction=5|Charm Monster|Seduction=6|Dominate Person|Seduction=7|Charm Monster (Mass)|Seduction=8|Dominate Monster|Seduction=9|Demand
Spirit	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Spirit	SOURCEPAGE:p.1360	DESC:You may create a spiritual bond between an item you have created (usually a doll or similar object) and a single enemy. Creating this item requires 100 gp and a sample of the hair, skin, fingernails, or other bodily material of the victim. You may cast any spell of 3rd level or lower with a touch range on the creature without making a touch attack roll by casting the spell on the bonded object. The creature gains a +2 circumstance bonus on its saving throw (if any) against the effect. You must be within long range (400 ft. + 40 ft. /level) of your target and have line of effect to it to use the object in this manner. You may create one of these items per month, but you may not have more than one active at a time. When you create a new bounded item, your previous one loses its power. [Dragon #312 (Among the Dead – Necromancer Archetypes and Abilities)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Spirit=1|Bane|Spirit=2|Scare|Spirit=3|Bestow Curse|Spirit=4|Death Ward|Spirit=5|Enervation|Spirit=6|Magic Jar|Spirit=7|Eyebite|Spirit=8|Finger of Death|Spirit=9|Soul Bind
Temperance	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Temperance	SOURCEPAGE:p.1361	DESC:When you prepare spells you immediately heal 1 hit point per spell level of domain spells you still have prepared from the previous day. For example, if you did not cast your 2nd-level and 4th-level domain spells the previous day you heal back 6 hit points when preparing your spells. [Dragon #355 (Seven Saintly Domains)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Temperance=1|Remove Fear|Temperance=2|Calm Emotions|Temperance=3|Dispel Magic|Temperance=4|Neutralize Poison|Temperance=5|Atonement|Temperance=6|Dispel Magic (Greater)|Temperance=7|Symbol of Stunning|Temperance=8|Shield of Law|Temperance=9|Iron Body
Undead	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Undead	SOURCEPAGE:p.1361	DESC:You gain a +2 competence bonus on your turning checks to turn or rebuke undead. [Dragon #312 (Among the Dead – Necromancer Archetypes and Abilities)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Undead=1|Chill Touch|Undead=2|Command Undead|Undead=3|Animate Dead|Undead=4|Halt Undead|Undead=5|Slay Living|Undead=6|Create Undead|Undead=7|Undeath to Death|Undead=8|Create Greater Undead|Undead=9|Wail of the Banshee
Zeal	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Zeal	SOURCEPAGE:p.1361	DESC:Once per day you may take 20 on a skill check without increasing the amount of time needed to make the check. You cannot take 20 on checks for which you cannot normally take 20 (such as Balance or Climb checks). [Dragon #355 (Seven Saintly Domains)]	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Zeal=1|Bless|Zeal=2|Consecrate|Zeal=3|Helping Hand|Zeal=4|Dismissal|Zeal=5|Commune|Zeal=6|Dispel Magic (Greater)|Zeal=7|Holy Word|Zeal=8|Holy Aura|Zeal=9|Miracle
